{"title":"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following integers cannot be written as the sum of four consecutive odd integers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/1/761eb3f095c0abe6258a4c37b0b5cf443d37ea48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\text{ 16}\\quad\\textbf{(B)}\\text{ 40}\\quad\\textbf{(C)}\\text{ 72}\\quad\\textbf{(D)}\\text{ 100}\\quad\\textbf{(E)}\\text{ 200}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"337\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let our <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/b/9ab599580530f7f88d47c7424f181ccfb9ff9521.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n, n+2, n+4, n+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"161\" height=\"16\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is odd. Then, our sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/d/38dedd5d5bf17e0d6c170b37d30e5d07f1c6e9e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n+12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />. The only answer choice that cannot be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/d/38dedd5d5bf17e0d6c170b37d30e5d07f1c6e9e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n+12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is odd, is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/4/994ace589f5b18c08c612218149350c6b58f5caf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\text{ 100}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"71\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>If the four consecutive odd integers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/3/28317bd83130a0a53a486eb02c2a7586f2b021a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n-3,~ 2n-1, ~2n+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/2/ce2450adbcfa47f4f4fdfd4ca11121f7db81648c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />; then, the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88f825e8eca022f48ac1d2d41cd80ad6e5d9ef9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8n$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />. All the integers are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> except <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/c/44c68fa8e4d2a06cffa174418eb1d98beea6a866.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>If the four consecutive odd integers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/2/592f50f6309f50f292e3d9b80cf4f1ef941f6801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,~ a+2, ~a+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"118\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/e/e0e88041d0a37f1c0b0e5ccc5b8ea63fc5dad0d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />, the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/f/78ff5404df7d9860e280d64064be88ac2f40e797.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a+12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/f/78ff5404df7d9860e280d64064be88ac2f40e797.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a+12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/a/c0a6d439363e4f3c029b2753b58cd91a34336db9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/a/c0a6d439363e4f3c029b2753b58cd91a34336db9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> must be even. The only integer that does not give an even integer when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/c/44c68fa8e4d2a06cffa174418eb1d98beea6a866.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>From Solution 1, we have the sum of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers to be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/f/eaf00ace7e0a51a5eea0935492974af3c6fffe54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />. Taking mod 8 gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/6/cb667563fb0069e054ebd9f763d4c24e742b4ede.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n + 4 \\equiv b \\pmod8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" /> for some residue <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and for some odd integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/a/56a5c5d3772d6b4c76f955e254c12563ca27b9ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 1 \\pmod{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />, we can express it as the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/e/06ee430aa040d8f8b2b34cd298b3da487e90af2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2a + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"15\" /> for some integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Multiplying 4 to each side of the equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77ce0ec84e96a4c865dfdd9f12c1bfbecc18ebc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n = 8a + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"94\" height=\"14\" />, and taking mod 8 gets us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/0/00006724695c4bb9d7eb1917643b82d4a3f4a7cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n \\equiv 4 \\pmod{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/7/be7a58270d4285821716c6093a83541f3ea31dc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 0$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. All the answer choices except choice D is a multiple of 8, and since 100 satisfies all the conditions the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/c/44c68fa8e4d2a06cffa174418eb1d98beea6a866.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since they want CONSECUTIVE odd numbers, it won't be hard to just list the sums out:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/6204f662662450cdbe75b27565b79cd88ee0dd55.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[16=1+3+5+7\\]\" width=\"144\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/312d83a548dde49ddd0a0c086d73de8fab761aee.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[40=7+9+11+13\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57c906e973e0620a3e0d75e2613952eb406c8791.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[72=15+17+19+21\\]\" width=\"179\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/4/9f435a1f68f1b821fae6493e28b37c8e5996b807.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[200=47+49+51+53\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"14\" />\nAll of the answer choices can be a sum of consecutive odd numbers except <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/1/ec1db09b22530da0ea07874520b167448909c39c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} 100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"70\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Xc7EYnJL5_c\">https://youtu.be/Xc7EYnJL5_c</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/khCUYxEJFQg\">https://youtu.be/khCUYxEJFQg</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 8\">2015 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2015\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018000129\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 289/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2272/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7352/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.925      1 -total\n 55.19%    7.134      1 Template:AMC8_box\n 42.47%    5.489      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14455:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018000129 and revision id 252474. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}